window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"camille","b":"locke","win":["Camille","Camille","Camille","Camille","Camille","Camille","Camille"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 2","text":"Early W poke plus the Q true-damage follow-up wins every short trade — keep the pressure rolling."},{"when":"Lvl 3","text":"Hookshot comes online — you now open every trade with a knock-up he can't preempt."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Hextech Ultimatum traps him with the full combo guaranteed — this is your kill stage, take it."},{"when":"1st item","text":"The one even window: Purgatory (120s) grounds your Hookshot and Ultimatum dash, so force his R out first or dive with a health buffer."}],"wants":{"you":["Q2 true-damage trades","Hookshot engages off cooldown","Ultimatum picks with his R down"],"foe":["Survive to first item","Totem answer to your Ultimatum","Poke before you can engage"]},"early":"You are the bully. The double-hit Q beats his poke at 1, W plus the Q true damage wins 2, and Hookshot at 3 opens every trade with a knock-up. Shield his Silver Stake on-hit with your passive — it scales off your MISSING health, so keep trades short and set up the 6 kill.","mid":"Hextech Ultimatum locks him in with the full combo guaranteed — the all-in is yours at 6, so take it while his HP is imperfect, and buy Grievous Wounds so Soul Ignition (W, 18s) cannot refund it. Respect one window: from first item, Purgatory grounds your Hookshot and Ultimatum dash outright, so force that 120s R out first.","late":"Two-plus items the isolation game is yours: Ultimatum cages him away from help, Hookshot reaches him over terrain, and true damage doesn't care what he builds. Hunt the pick in the sidelane and dive under tower — but never step in with Purgatory up, because grounded you have no dash at all.","whys":["Camille owns level 1 — the double-hit Q with its true-damage second strike beats his walk-up poke outright.","Level 2 stays yours: early W poke and the Q follow-up keep every short trade in your favor.","Level 3 is yours — Hookshot engages are online, so you open trades with a knock-up he can't preempt.","Levels 4-5 keep the boot down: the Q-W combo out-trades his on-hit pattern every rotation.","Level 6 is Camille's — Hextech Ultimatum traps him and guarantees the full combo lands. This is your kill stage.","First item is the one even stage: Purgatory grounds both your Hookshot and your Ultimatum dash and can execute you, so force that 120s R out before you commit.","Late is yours again — dive range, isolation and true damage make you the pick threat he can never fully peel."]});
