window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"camille","b":"masteryi","win":["Camille","Camille","Camille","Skill","Master Yi","Master Yi","Camille"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 3","text":"The E-wall knock-up into full combo is a genuine kill window he can't answer — your biggest lane moment."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Highlander makes him slow-immune, Wuju true damage ignores your shield — respect phase begins."},{"when":"1st item","text":"His DPS wins any stuck fight — switch to Q poke, hit-and-run, and E-over-walls disengages."},{"when":"Late","text":"You return as the anti-Yi: E-R lockdown pins him and your Hookshot knock-up cancels the Meditate channel outright."}],"wants":{"you":["Early chunks off Q true damage","Exits pre-planned at his 6","Late Ultimatum picks on him"],"foe":["Reach 6 alive","Stick to you at one item","Reset room in teamfights"]},"early":"Punish him before he exists. Your enhanced Q out-damages his basics at 1, kill pressure mounts at 2, and the level 3 E-wall knock-up into full combo is a genuine kill window he can't answer. Chunk him every rotation, shield his trade-backs with your passive, and force him to burn resources just to farm.","mid":"By 4 his Wuju points level the trades, and from 6 the fight is his: Highlander makes him immune to your W slow and Wuju Style's true damage ignores your shield, and at first item he out-DPSes you in any stuck fight. Switch modes — Q poke and leave, E over walls to disengage, and bank your early lead on plates and mid-map moves.","late":"You come back late as the anti-Yi: the E knock-up cancels a Meditate channel outright, Ultimatum cages him away from your carries, and your true damage ignores what he builds. Bring Grievous Wounds for Meditate, wait out an untargetable Alpha Strike, and never face-tank a reset chain.","whys":["Camille owns level 1 — the enhanced Q hit out-damages his basic attacks in every exchange.","Level 2 stays yours: Q pressure plus real early kill threat keeps him pinned to his tower.","Level 3 is yours outright — the E-wall knock-up into full combo is damage he simply cannot answer yet.","By 4 his Wuju Style points even the lane — trades turn honest, so take them only on your cooldowns.","Master Yi takes level 6: Highlander makes him immune to your W slow and Wuju Style's true damage ignores your shield entirely. Keep exits ready.","First item is his — Wuju true damage out-DPSes you in any stuck fight. Poke with Q and leave before he settles in.","Late is Camille's: E-R lockdown, a Hookshot that cancels his Meditate channel, and true damage of your own let you pick him off and peel your carries."]});
